# Promoted replays are raw evidence, committed byte for byte: bpftool pads its columns and raw HTTP
# headers end their lines with CRLF, so neither the whitespace check nor line-ending conversion
# (as `core.autocrlf=input` would do) may touch them.
authoritative/** -whitespace -text
